/cell-ontology/issues/3382\"\n}\n D .github/copilot-instructions.md\n M CLAUDE.md\n?? AGENTS.md\n?? __agent_config__/\n?? __agent_prompt__.md\n?? __issue_context__.json\n?? __pr_result__/\n?? obo-scripts/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
